      "items": [
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ01",
          "display_order": 1,
          "text": "只有孩子对我笑的时候我才能确定孩子是喜欢我的。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ02",
          "display_order": 2,
          "text": "我总是知道孩子想要什么。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ03",
          "display_order": 3,
          "text": "我喜欢思考孩子的行为和感受以及背后的原因。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ04",
          "display_order": 4,
          "text": "孩子在陌生人面前哭闹让我很窘迫。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ05",
          "display_order": 5,
          "text": "我完全能读懂孩子的内心。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ06",
          "display_order": 6,
          "text": "我很想知道孩子的想法和感受。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ07",
          "display_order": 7,
          "text": "我发现我自己很难主动地和孩子一起玩角色游戏。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ08",
          "display_order": 8,
          "text": "我总是能预测出孩子将要做什么。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ09",
          "display_order": 9,
          "text": "很多时候我想知道孩子是什么感受。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ10",
          "display_order": 10,
          "text": "有时候因为孩子生病而阻止了我去做我想要做的事情。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ11",
          "display_order": 11,
          "text": "我有时会对孩子的反应做出错误的判断。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": true
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ12",
          "display_order": 12,
          "text": "我试图用孩子的眼光来看待各种情况。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ13",
          "display_order": 13,
          "text": "当我的孩子胡搅蛮缠时，他（她）只是想气我。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ14",
          "display_order": 14,
          "text": "我一直很清楚我对孩子所做的一切以及原因。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ15",
          "display_order": 15,
          "text": "我尽力去了解孩子不良行为的原因。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ16",
          "display_order": 16,
          "text": "很多时候孩子的行为表现非常令人迷惑，不知道为什么他会那样。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_PM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ17",
          "display_order": 17,
          "text": "我一直很清楚孩子所作所为的原因。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_CM",
          "reverse_scored": false
        },
        {
          "item_code": "PRFQ18",
          "display_order": 18,
          "text": "我觉得猜测孩子的心理感受是没有意义的。",
          "dimension": "PRFQ_IC",
          "reverse_scored": true
        }
      ],
